included in the published tarball.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Specifications referenced
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package implements the Facet Agent Terminal client protocol
(MCP + HTTP + KYAPay ES256 JWT). It references:

    - Model Context Protocol (MCP), Anthropic PBC et al.
      https://modelcontextprotocol.io/
    - KYAPay — Know-Your-Agent token specification, IETF draft stage.
    - RFC 9421 — HTTP Message Signatures (response signature verification).
    - RFC 7519 — JSON Web Token (JWT).

All references are fair-use quotations for interoperability; no
specification text is re-published verbatim in this package's source.

